-- Per-set sealed template (David 2026-11-27, "at least for now"): every main set has a booster box, two booster
-- pack art slots, two blister pack art slots (+ the set-level blister), theme deck slots as the set has them, and
-- set-specific extras (3-pack blisters…) as David names them. Unnamed slots and blisters not confirmed for a set are
